w’s perfect — we’ll do that 20‑minute walkthrough with Jay, no commitment, just see it in action for Precision Auto Care.  \n\nSo first thing, what’s your first name?\nUser: I'm Danny.\nAgent: Got it, Danny — thanks.  \n\nAnd Danny, what’s your last name?\nUser: Reyes.\nAgent: Perfect, thanks Danny Reyes.  \n\nFor tomorrow, I can get you in as soon as 10:00am or 10:45am Central — which works better for you?\nUser: 10:45am Central works for me.\nAgent: One moment while I confirm that.\nAgent: Thanks, Danny! You’re all set — Jay will call you tomorrow at 10:45am Central on this number. You’ll get a text with the confirmation details in a minute so you can add it to your calendar or reschedule if something comes up.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with before we wrap up?\n\nAlright, really glad you called — Jay’s looking forward to meeting you and helping Precision Auto Care stop losing those after-hours jobs. Have a great rest of your day. Bye!",
